00:01:18,624 --> 00:01:22,154
The call This is the pile you keep moving
instead of deciding on: exercise books,

21
00:01:22,154 --> 00:01:25,684
paintings, a folder of worksheets, and the
flat certainty that binning any of it

22
00:01:25,684 --> 00:01:29,214
means you did not care.

23
00:01:29,214 --> 00:01:32,743
Take the judgement out of the moment and
put it into a container.

24
00:01:32,743 --> 00:01:36,273
One memory box per child per school year,
an actual box with a lid and a fixed

25
00:01:36,273 --> 00:01:39,803
size, kept on the wardrobe top.

26
00:01:39,803 --> 00:01:43,333
When it is full it is full, and the way
you make room is by taking something out,

27
00:01:43,333 --> 00:01:46,863
not by getting a second box.

28
00:01:46,863 --> 00:01:50,393
Photograph the oversized art and let the
paper go.

29
00:01:50,393 --> 00:01:53,922
Keep the pieces where you can genuinely
see their hand getting better, because

30
00:01:53,922 --> 00:01:57,452
those are the ones worth opening in ten
years.

31
00:01:57,452 --> 00:02:00,982
The size of the box makes the call so you
do not have to make it at nine o'clock on

32
